    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635950/extras/a1d90e223ecd7dad77038daf97f492bd.avif?t=1754918901\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, survive, and escape the liminal realm you find yourself trapped in. Inspired by urban exploration and abandoned malls, utilize nostalgic 90s toys to aid you while you run and hide from the mall's inhabitants. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to leave behind breadcrumbs and try not to get lost, as every new sector of this eerie architectural sprawl is procedurally generated.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635950/extras/c48f7d5ebd77c12cdd73ec3eb0c80f1d.webp?t=1754918901\" width=400 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every door you see leads somewhere. No areas are off-limits! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635950/extras/be6dfaf5968144ec36d3d1146453d922.webp?t=1754918901\" width=400 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new sector is procedurally generated with unique and unpredictable connections. Explore to find shortcuts and hidden rooms that may help you in your escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635950/extras/67ea5c476a576f93aeabfe5d48bcaf16.webp?t=1754918901\" width=400 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new monster has its own personality and unique abilities that you will need to learn from and adapt to as you explore.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635950/extras/a1d90e223ecd7dad77038daf97f492bd.avif?t=1754918901\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, survive, and escape the liminal realm you find yourself trapped in. Inspired by urban exploration and abandoned malls, utilize nostalgic 90s toys to aid you while you run and hide from the mall's inhabitants. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to leave behind breadcrumbs and try not to get lost, as every new sector of this eerie architectural sprawl is procedurally generated.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635950/extras/c48f7d5ebd77c12cdd73ec3eb0c80f1d.webp?t=1754918901\" width=400 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every door you see leads somewhere. No areas are off-limits! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635950/extras/be6dfaf5968144ec36d3d1146453d922.webp?t=1754918901\" width=400 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new sector is procedurally generated with unique and unpredictable connections. Explore to find shortcuts and hidden rooms that may help you in your escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635950/extras/67ea5c476a576f93aeabfe5d48bcaf16.webp?t=1754918901\" width=400 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new monster has its own personality and unique abilities that you will need to learn from and adapt to as you explore.</p>",
